kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948230/extras/GifGame.gif?t=1741735653\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948230/extras/thecats.png?t=1741735653\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All our cats come from other Indie video games. We wanted to celebrate their existence by creating a game in their honor. So you'll be able to see your favourite characters hidden here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948230/extras/barcelona.png?t=1741735653\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Barcelona offers tons of amazing places, some of them sure you have already heard about, but others we hope to surprise you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948230/extras/GifBarcelona.gif?t=1741735653\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948230/extras/soundtrack.png?t=1741735653\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And what about sound? Oh, sound is so amazing and powerful! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019ve teamed up with Dash Obradors and lots of places have sounds, so click all over and discover them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948230/extras/GifSoundtrack.gif?t=1741735653\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Can Pixel Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948230/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1741735653","is_free":false,"li